# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/
/gen/schemas

# OAuth app credentials — never commit. .env.enc is derived from .env (via
# `cargo run --example encrypt_env`) and regenerated locally, not something to version either.
# .enc_key is the AES key build.rs generates on first build — must never be committed
# either, or the encryption in env_crypto.rs is pointless on a public repo.
/.env
/.env.enc
/.enc_key
